[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バーバラ号があっという間に小さくなっちった。\n本格的な外洋船はやっぱり違うすなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Barbara is already just a speck in the distance. Real ocean-faring vessels sure are something else!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "耐久性にも差があるし、あんまり無茶はできないからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're way more durable too. We can't exactly push our luck with this one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神聖国が貸してくれた船だから\n無理して壊さないようにしなきゃね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nova lent us this ship, so we'd better not damage it by being reckless."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。アタシを認めてくれた証だし……\nアルビ号、これからもよろしくね！\u3000愛してる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right! It's proof that they believe in me... my own ship! I'm counting on you, my darling ship!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おやぁ……？\nねえ、アルビー！\u3000後ろから船が来てるみたいだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm...? Hey, Alvie! There's a ship coming up behind us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしかしてフロッケ号？\n東メンソスで早くも何かあったとか……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that the Flocke? Did something arise in East Mensos so soon...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おわーっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んもう、いきなり矢を飛ばして来るなんて……。\nあの船、まさか海賊船？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firing arrows at us out of nowhere like that... Don't tell me that's a pirate ship?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海賊ぅ！？\u3000ホントにいるんだそんなの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pirates!? They actually exist!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "諸島同盟の外じゃ、ああいう血なまぐさい連中も\n野放しになってるからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Outside the Archipelago Federation, violent types like that run wild pretty freely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大事なアルビ号に矢を射かけるなんて！\n許せない！\u3000ぎったんばったん大騒ぎじゃい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How dare they shoot arrows at my precious ship! Simply unforgivable! It's time for some payback!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあまあ、船長は怒らない。\nこういうのは新入りの仕事だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Easy there, captain. There's no need to get worked up. Leave this to the new recruit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっとやって来るよ。\n接舷お願いね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll handle this real quick. Just pull us alongside them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hup!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What the—!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "海賊",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pirate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだっ！？\u3000ぐわぁっ！\nこいつっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who's this!? Gwaah! Argh—!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "海賊たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pirates"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すごい……あっという間に制圧しちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... She took them down in a blink of an eye."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたちが出る幕、ないみたい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It doesn't look like we need to step in..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、ざっとこんなもんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, that about does it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがイェルカの姉御。\nそこらの海賊なんて敵じゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Common pirates are no match for Jelka of the Miraculous Nine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よせやい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aw, knock it off."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この人たち、どうしようかしら？\u3000神聖国としては、\n同盟外のいざこざにはあまり関わりたくないけれど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What should we do with them? Nova would prefer not to get too involved in disputes outside the alliance..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつらのやってきたこと次第じゃあ\n海に沈めて魚の餌でもいいけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Depending on what they've done, I wouldn't mind tossing them overboard as fish food."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今回は武器を取り上げて、近くの島に突き出すくらいで\n勘弁してやるよ。ここはレスナ流のやり方でってことで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But let's go with Resna's way of doing things this time and just confiscate their weapons before turning them in to the authorities on the nearest island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、そうしてくれると助かるよ。\n合わせてくれてありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, that'd work. Let's go with that, then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はは、郷に入っては郷に従えって言うしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, looks like Resna's really rubbing off on me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]